ae5cf6079067db912f470.600x338.jpg?t=1676445597"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878930/ss_2b422beb68b5c860cae3fce88c7bd02532ac22e0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1676445597","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878930/ss_2b422beb68b5c860cae3fce88c7bd02532ac22e0.600x338.jpg?t=1676445597"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878930/ss_a69ead68c62f00156ca0491faa3052bd5c6c3115.1920x1080.jpg?t=1676445597","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878930/ss_a69ead68c62f00156ca0491faa3052bd5c6c3115.600x338.jpg?t=1676445597"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878930/ss_14873c9312056e0a56120154b5712311a7930b7e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1676445597","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878930/ss_14873c9312056e0a56120154b5712311a7930b7e.600x338.jpg?t=1676445597"}],"short_description":"Labyrinth is an intense close ranged hack n slash focused on steel vs steel action in deep and deadly battles against nightmarish demons within a mysterious labyrinth that promises to lead triumphant warriors off their dying world.","steam_appid":1878930,"support_info":{"email":"info@craftshop-arts.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":null}